diff --git a/docs/RemixNumosAPI.md b/docs/RemixNumosAPI.md
index c9d673c51..b3e21e2d2 100644
--- a/docs/RemixNumosAPI.md
+++ b/docs/RemixNumosAPI.md
@@ -34,6 +34,8 @@ and set the numeric fields. All selection and blending take place in memory.
 The `rays.` options control a camera-only pass over the sun's single scattering beyond the near haze.
 `enable` and `strength` switch it or scale the removed sunlight. `quality` follows sky quality at -1.
 `rangeKm`, `steps` and `historyWeight` control its reach, sampling and temporal filter.
+A shared gain caps the loss at two stops in every sky channel. The march uses the renderer's spatiotemporal
+blue noise and filters reprojected history on the ray grid. Its correction stops at the NUMOS planet limb.
 `debugView` shows removed light (1), the unshadowed integral (2), shadowed distance fraction (3),
 or start and end in red and green on a logarithmic distance scale (4).
 
