 counter continues to count the actual constructor and destructor.
+
+## Enhanced ray reconstruction after the first review (2026-11-26)
+
+The ray pass binds the existing blue-noise array in `rtx_fork_numos_rays.cpp`. The Enhanced composite uses a
+common spectral gain and the planet tangent in both its normal and diagnostic fills. Its base variant and the
+mist and rainbow implementations keep their previous paths. `test_enhanced_sky.cpp` checks the limiting
+channel, zero radiance channels and the horizon of an elevated camera.
